      "text": "let us be strong like unto Moses, 1 Ne. 4:2. Moses is commanded to lead Israel out of bondage, 1 Ne. 17:24–26 (2 Ne. 3:10). Moses smote rock and water came forth, 1 Ne. 17:29. Israelites reviled against Moses, 1 Ne. 17:30, 42. Christ is prophet like unto Moses that the Lord would raise, 1 Ne. 22:20–21 (3 Ne. 20:23; 21:11; Deut. 18:15). latter-day prophet like unto Moses to be named Joseph, 2 Ne. 3:9–17. Moses was given power by God, 2 Ne. 25:20 (Hel. 8:11–13). the Lord delivered commandments to Moses in mount of Sinai, Mosiah 12:33. Abinadi’s face shines even as Moses’, Mosiah 13:5. Moses prophesied about the Messiah, Mosiah 13:33. Alma2 is buried by hand of the Lord even as Moses, Alma 45:19. if church is called by Moses’ name, it is Moses’ church, 3 Ne. 27:8.",
